<!-- Unified status-bar notification mark: the MatChat bubble + "M", the same
     geometry as the launcher (ic_launcher.xml) and the cover/outer-screen mark
     (ic_cover_matchat.png). Status-bar icons are drawn from the alpha channel
     and tinted by the system, so this is a single-colour silhouette: the bubble
     is filled white with the "M" knocked out (evenOdd), which reads as the
     brand mark in the status bar and matches the monochrome outer screen. Used
     for every MatChat notification (messages, sync, calls) so the icon is the
     same everywhere. -->
